{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-8-1","title":"Proverbs 8:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The fame, 6 and evidence of wisdom. 10 The excellency, 12 the nature, 15 the power, 18 the riches, 22 and the eternity of wisdom. 32 Wisdom is to be desired for the blessedness it brings.</p>\n<p>1:20,21; 9:1-3; Isa 49:1-6; 55:1-3; Mt 3:3; 4:17; 28:19,20 Mr 13:10; 16:15,16; Lu 24:47; Joh 7:37; Ac 1:8; 22:21; Ro 15:18-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-3","title":"Proverbs 8:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Mt 22:9; Lu 14:21-23; Joh 18:20; Ac 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-4","title":"Proverbs 8:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Ps 49:1-3; 50:1; Mt 11:15; Joh 3:16; 2Co 5:19,20; Col 1:23,28 1Ti 2:4-6; Tit 2:11,12; Re 22:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-5","title":"Proverbs 8:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>1:22; 9:4; Ps 19:7; 94:8; Isa 42:13; 55:1-3; Ac 26:18; 1Co 1:28 1Co 6:9-11; Re 3:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-6","title":"Proverbs 8:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>for. 2:6,7; 4:2,20-22; 22:20,21; Ps 19:7-11; 49:3; 1Co 2:6,7; Col 1:26 the opening. Job 33:1-3; Mt 5:2-12; 7:28,29; 13:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-7","title":"Proverbs 8:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>my mouth. Job 36:4; Joh 1:17; 8:14,45,46; 14:6; 17:17; 18:37; Re 3:14 an abomination to. Heb. the abomination of. 12:22; 16:12; 29:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-8","title":"Proverbs 8:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>All. Ps 12:6; Isa 45:23; 63:1 there. 13; Joh 7:46 froward. Heb. wreathed.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-9","title":"Proverbs 8:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>14:6; 15:14,24; 17:24; 18:1,2,15; Ps 19:7,8; 25:12-14; 119:98-100 Isa 35:8; Mic 2:7; Mt 13:11,12; Joh 6:45; 7:17; 1Co 2:14,15 Jas 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-10","title":"Proverbs 8:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>2:4,5; 3:13,14; 10:20; 16:16; 23:23; Ps 119:72,127,162; Ec 7:11 Ac 3:6; 2Co 6:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-11","title":"Proverbs 8:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>wisdom. 3:14; 4:5-7; 16:16; 20:15; Job 28:15-19; Ps 19:10; 119:127 Mt 16:26; Php 3:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-12","title":"Proverbs 8:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>I wisdom. Ps 104:24; Isa 55:8,9; Ro 11:33; Eph 1:8,11; 3:10; Col 2:3 prudence. or, subtlety. knowledge. Ex 31:3-6; 35:30-35; 36:1-4; 1Ki 7:14; 1Ch 28:12,19; 2Ch 13:14 Isa 28:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-13","title":"Proverbs 8:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>The fear. 16:6; Ps 97:10; 101:3; 119:104,128; Am 5:15; Ro 12:9; 1Th 5:22 2Ti 2:19 pride. 6:16-19; 1Sa 2:3; Ps 5:4,5; 138:6; Zec 8:17; 1Pe 5:5 the froward. 4:24; 6:12; 10:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-14","title":"Proverbs 8:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Counsel. Isa 9:6; 40:14; Joh 1:9; Ro 11:33,34; 1Co 1:24,30; Col 2:3 sound. 2:6,7; Ro 1:22 I have. 24:5; Ec 7:19; 9:16-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-15","title":"Proverbs 8:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>By. 1Sa 9:17; 16:1; 1Ch 28:5; Jer 27:5-7; Da 2:21; 4:25,32; 5:18-31 Da 7:13,14; Mt 28:18; Ro 13:1; Re 19:16 decree. 1Ki 3:9,28; 5:7; 10:9; Ps 72:1-4; 99:4; Isa 1:26; 32:1,2; Jer 33:15 Re 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-17","title":"Proverbs 8:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I love. 1Sa 2:30; Ps 91:14; Joh 14:21,23; 16:27; 1Jo 4:19 those. Ec 12:1; Isa 45:19; 55:6; Mt 6:33; 7:7,8; Mr 10:14; Jas 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-18","title":"Proverbs 8:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Riches and honour. 3:16; 4:7-9; Jas 2:5 durable. Ps 36:6; Ec 5:14-16; Mt 6:19,20; Lu 10:42; 12:20,21,33; 16:11,12 2Co 6:10; Eph 3:8; Php 4:19; 1Ti 6:17-19; Jas 5:1-3; Re 3:18 and righteousness. 11:4; Mt 6:33; Php 3:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-19","title":"Proverbs 8:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>10; 3:14; Ec 7:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-20","title":"Proverbs 8:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>lead. or, walk. 3:6; 4:11,12; 6:22; Ps 23:3; 25:4,5; 32:8; Isa 2:3; 49:10; 55:4 Joh 10:3,27,28; Re 7:17 in the. 4:25-27; De 5:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-21","title":"Proverbs 8:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>to inherit. 18; 1:13; 6:31; Ge 15:14; 1Sa 2:8; Mt 25:46; Joh 1:1-18; Ro 8:17 Heb 10:34; 1Pe 1:4 fill. Ps 16:11; Eph 3:19,20; Re 21:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-22","title":"Proverbs 8:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>3:19; Joh 1:1,2; Col 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-23","title":"Proverbs 8:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Ge 1:26; Ps 2:6; Mic 5:2; Joh 17:24; Eph 1:10,11; 1Jo 1:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-24","title":"Proverbs 8:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>I was. Ps 2:7; Joh 1:14; 3:16; 5:20; Heb 1:5; 1Jo 4:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-25","title":"Proverbs 8:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Job 15:7,8; 38:4-11; Ps 90:2; 102:25-28; Heb 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-26","title":"Proverbs 8:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>as yet. Ge 1:1-31 fields. or, open places. highest part. or, chief part.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-27","title":"Proverbs 8:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>he prepared. Ps 33:6; 103:19; 136:5; Jer 10:12; Col 1:16; Heb 1:2 compass. or, circle. Isa 40:11,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-29","title":"Proverbs 8:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>he gave. Ge 1:9,10; Job 38:8-11; Ps 33:7; 104:9; Jer 5:22 when he appointed. Job 38:4-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-30","title":"Proverbs 8:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>one. Joh 1:1-3,18; 16:28 I was daily. Isa 42:1; Mt 3:17; 17:5; Joh 12:28; Col 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-31","title":"Proverbs 8:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>and my. Ps 16:3; 40:6-8; Joh 4:34; 13:1; 2Co 8:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-32","title":"Proverbs 8:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>for. Ps 1:1-4; 119:1,2; 128:1; Lu 11:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-33","title":"Proverbs 8:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>Hear. 1:2,3,8; 4:1; 5:1; Isa 55:1-3; Ro 10:16,17 refuse. 1:21; Ps 81:11,12; Ac 7:35-37; Heb 12:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-34","title":"Proverbs 8:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>watching. 1:21; 2:3,4; Ps 27:4; 84:10; 92:13; Mt 7:24; Lu 1:6; 10:39; 11:28 Joh 8:31,32; Ac 2:42; 17:11,12; Jas 1:22-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-35","title":"Proverbs 8:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>whoso. 1:33; 3:13-18; Joh 3:16,36; 14:6; Php 3:8; Col 3:3; 1Jo 5:11,12 obtain. Heb. bring forth. favour. 12:2; Eph 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-8-36","title":"Proverbs 8:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>he. 1:31; 20:2; Joh 3:19,20; Ac 13:46; Heb 2:3; 10:29 all. 5:11,12,22,23; Eze 18:31; 33:11; Joh 15:23,24; 1Co 16:22</p>"}]}